    "title": "Who is Justin Rose? What to know about age, wife and career earnings",
    "text": "The day started with Rory McIlroy and Cameron Young tied for first. But as of publication, Justin Rose is in the lead to win this year's Masters, something he has attempted nearly two dozen times now with three runner-up finishes.Rose was born on July 30, 1980 making him 45.AdvertisementWhere is Justin Rose from?Rose was born in Johannesburg, South Africa and lives in London, according to his PGA biography.How many PGA Tour competitions has Justin Rose won?Rose has 13 wins under his belt, including the U.S. Open and an Olympic gold medal.Apr 12, 2026; Augusta, Georgia, USA; Justin Rose reacts after making a birdie putt on the eighth green during the final round of the Masters Tournament at Augusta National Golf Club. Mandatory Credit: Bill Streicher-Imagn ImagesHas Justin Rose won the Masters?This year marks Rose's 21st Masters. He's landed in second place three times. Two of those have been in playoff losses (2017 to Sergio Garcia and 2025 to Rory McIlroy).How much is Justin Rose worth?Rose has accumulated almost $75 million in PGA prize money throughout his career. His net worth estimate fluctuates, but it seems to hover around $40 million to $50 million.Who is Justin Rose's wife?Rose's wife is gymnast Kate Phillips. The two have been married since 2006.AdvertisementDoes Justin Rose have any children?Rose and Phillips have a son, Leo, and a daughter, Charlotte, according to People Magazine.FILE - Justin Rose poses with his wife, Kate and children Charlotte and Leo with the Gene Sarazen trophy after winning the WGC-Cadillac Championship PGA golf tournament at the Doral Golf Resort in Florida on March 11, 2012.Justin Rose's odds of wining Masters 2026As of publication, BetMGM gives Rose the second best odds at winning the Masters at +160 behind McIlroy at +138.Miguel Legoas is a Deep South Connect Team Reporter for USA Today. Find him on Instagram @miguelegoas and email at mlegoas@gannett.com.This article originally appeared on Augusta Chronicle: 2026 golfer Justin Rose's age, net worth, wins, and more",
